cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below. It is a claims audit: it classifies public claims against their sources and does not itself claim a consciousness mechanism, clinical relevance, or current quantum-computer availability."
title: "Quantum Claims Evidence Passport: an offline audit of a Swiss quantum hub announcement and a modeled 613 THz anesthetic/microtubule frequency band"
