abstract: >-
  Offline, Python-standard-library CLI and static HTML report that separates an
  institutional announcement and future deployment plan from computational or
  theoretical modeling, animal behavioral evidence, hypotheses, and unsupported
  inferences. Converts the reported 613 +/- 8 THz modeled band with exact SI
  constants for scale only. Fail-closed validation fences claims about
  consciousness mechanisms, current operation, direct measurement, or proof.
  No affiliation with IBM, Lockheed Martin, ETH Zurich, or CSCS is implied.
  Not medical, scientific, or investment advice. Audit snapshot 2026-10-05.
keywords:
